{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/12/7105311/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人の皆さまおめでとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂成人メンバーも\n色とりどりの振袖できれいだったなあ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに卒業した私の相棒の\nりさこも成人なのですが\n史上最強にかわいい写メが\n送られてきたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに見せたかったな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は両親と乃木坂聖地巡礼した！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂駅構内→乃木神社→渋谷TSUTAYA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂駅構内は乃木神社に近い出口側から\nあいうえお順でずらーっと\nパネルが貼ってありました(๑⁰ -⁰)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/12/7105311/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの乃木ヲタさんが\nパネルの通りに居た！\nこの後乃木坂のイベントが近くで\nあるんじゃないかってくらい\nたくさんの人が居た！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休日なのにみんな来てくれてて\n嬉しいな～と思いながら\nみんなの横を歩いてました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然気づかれなかったよ( ⁰౪⁰ )(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/12/7105311/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな素敵な表も貼ってあったよ！\nみんなぜひこれを参考にしてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今年二度目の乃木神社♡\nこの間来た時に去年のお守り\n返すの忘れてたから><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お参りして絵馬書いたよ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/12/7105311/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷TSUTAYAさんは私はこの間行ったので\n両親だけ中に入って楽しんでました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/12/7105311/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センター街で僕がいる場所流れてたし\nどこいっても乃木坂乃木坂乃木坂で\nすごい幸せな気分になりました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷TSUTAYAさんは今日までだけど\n乃木坂駅は1月いっぱいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/12/7105311/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/12/7105311/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとり旅行くならどこいきたいの～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少し暖かくなってから\n北海道にいってみたいなあ～～♡\n海鮮丼♡ラーメン♡スープカレー♡\nジンギスカン♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと山形県天童市も今年のうちに\n一度訪れてみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}